[A Druid][OC]Look for a *Devilsaur* or *Ironhide Devilsaur*. Avoid *Tyrant Devilsaurs* \\ You should be able to see their patrols on your map \\ The way you do this is spamming *Hibernate*. You should only spam *Hibernate* and nothing else. If it breaks early start spamming *Hibernate* again, they run with 170% movement speed so you can't outrun a *Devilsaur* \\ Use the *Devilsaur Barb* on it once it has been *Hibernated* \\ Shift into *Travel Form* and run away to reset it after \\ [QC9051,1 Toxic Test][UI22432-]
