[A Warlock][O][OR]At level 50 or higher, choose one way to start the class chain. In Stormwind speak to *Demisette Cloyce* [L 39.2,85 Stormwind City] or in Ironforge to *Briarthorn* [L 50.34,5.66 Ironforge] to accept [QA8419 An Imp's Request]. Alternatively, go directly to *Impsy* [L 41.52,44.99 Felwood] and accept [QA8420 Hot and Itchy]. You can accept before you have the Felcloth. Tick this step if you are skipping the class chain.
